== The Legend of the Submerged Titan ==
Once a fiery serpent igniting the world, Constorch evolved into the rock-clad Tophistone, shaping the land with volcanic fury. Its ultimate form, Titannon, was a titan of flame and earth. But when the world flooded, the volcanic titan was submerged, its fiery heart now dormant beneath the waves. They say it sleeps, awaiting the day when it'll rise again, to shape the world anew.
